    <string name="help_books">books: your eReader. books opens the library · books -last carries on with the book you read last · books -last epub, pdf, text or comic carries on with the last of that kind. Reads EPUB, PDF, TXT, Markdown and CBZ comics from folders you pick, with no storage permission. In a book, tap the edges to turn and the middle for the menu; hold a word to copy, share, translate or pin it. help -topic ereader has the full guide.</string>
